+     - Stores `TokenMeta` (34B) and `GenesisInfo` keyed by the `GENESIS` transaction's 8-byte `token_tx_num`, and `DbTokenTx` (referencing `token_tx_nums` by compact index rather than 32-byte `TokenId`) in `token_tx`.
